name: Stone Joker — stone-card chips
author: corpus
description: >-
  Stone Joker gives +25 Chips for each Stone card in the full deck. Lua `enhancement_gate`
  means real shops require a Stone card in deck before it can appear; Motely can still search
  the raw first-shop slot. RAG aliases: stone card chips, Marble Joker engine, Tower enabler,
  Splash stone scoring.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: StoneJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: MarbleJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - tarotCard: TheTower
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
    label: "The Tower (enhances 1 card to Stone directly)"
